{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-21","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内部折线的长度与夹角","englishTitle":"If on one of the sides of a triangle, from its extremities, there be constructed two straight lines meeting within the triangle, the straight lines so constructed will be less than the remaining two sides of the triangle, but will contain a greater angle.","book":1,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","contentId":"euclid-1-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db968d6fd5ac16b09398134ef45536f921d900bc94fa65df48bbce9376499648","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-21.statement","euclid-1-21.proof.1","euclid-1-21.proof.2","euclid-1-21.construction.1","euclid-1-21.proof.3","euclid-1-21.construction.2","euclid-1-21.proof.4","euclid-1-21.proof.5","euclid-1-21.proof.6","euclid-1-21.proof.7","euclid-1-21.proof.8","euclid-1-21.conclusion","euclid-1-21.historical.1","euclid-1-21.historical.2","euclid-1-21.historical.3","euclid-1-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4253bed10e1e63b8d5cbd9415838f559975da5c990f05fea00f30fd41f57af03","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If on one of the sides of a triangle, from its extremities, there be constructed two straight lines meeting within the triangle, the straight lines so constructed will be less than the remaining two sides of the triangle, but will contain a greater angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在三角形的一条边上，从该边两个端点分别向三角形内部作两条相交线段，则这两条内侧线段的长度之和小于原三角形其余两边的长度之和；它们所夹的角大于原三角形对应的角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形于一边之两界出两线复作一三角形在其内则内形两腰并之必小于相对两腰而后两线所作角必大于相对角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从三角形一边的两个端点引出两条线，在其内部构成另一个三角形，那么内三角形两腰的长度之和一定小于外三角形对应两边的长度之和；这两条内侧线段所夹的角大于外三角形对应的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0d355ac93d4627561f3b23c30739c1e118caa8f498be0b5bd87a1a4abee6ff2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On BC, one of the sides of the triangle ABC, from its extremities B, C, let the two straight lines BD, DC be constructed meeting within the triangle;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在三角形 ABC 的一条边 BC 上，从端点 B、C 分别作线段 BD、DC，使它们在三角形内部交于点 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93d3346c994be11f56e0f5c9f89b8e88d1955b72fccc9529855e37db93820323","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that BD, DC are less than the remaining two sides of the triangle BA, AC, but contain an angle BDC greater than the angle BAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：BD 与 DC 的长度之和小于 BA 与 AC 的长度之和，并且角 BDC 大于角 BAC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df6f5dcb162b3cd9778e7ecfe20c0f61a253793a9e8d342720824af6c86df80a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BD be drawn through to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将线段 BD 延长，直到与边 AC 相交于点 E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ed728c6bedfe9da9802b6eb8bdd887d3185fb4f3009c271883e904a8c609f85","citations":["euclid-1-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since in any triangle two sides are greater than the remaining one, [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)] therefore, in the triangle ABE, the two sides AB, AE are greater than BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为任意三角形的两边之和大于第三边 [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]，所以在三角形 ABE 中，AB 与 AE 的长度之和大于 BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d0819cbc0c6a9205acbfd441c0c00911e05a620217d47c64f613e6aa52b9799","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EC be added to each; therefore BA, AC are greater than BE, EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在不等式两边同时加上线段 EC，得到 BA 与 AC 的长度之和大于 BE 与 EC 的长度之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9721baa3b9785fcf5dbe84b48a3183e25a2fb2e66f5b86fb73ccee3dc7a280c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, in the triangle CED, the two sides CE, ED are greater than CD, let DB be added to each; therefore CE, EB are greater than CD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"又因为在三角形 CED 中，CE 与 ED 的长度之和大于 CD，所以两边同时加上 DB，可得 CE 与 EB 的长度之和大于 CD 与 DB 的长度之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1e2ffba383c1caef0c91b0a8ddaa27e967860840a6cf6b6648bb58b43a4703d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BA, AC were proved greater than BE, EC; therefore BA, AC are much greater than BD, DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"已经证明 BA 与 AC 的长度之和大于 BE 与 EC 的长度之和，因此更可推出 BA 与 AC 的长度之和大于 BD 与 DC 的长度之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccc5d1a047eb764dbadb2792b7abcd9dece5fe47404a4498baeecced02ec5fbe","citations":["euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since in any triangle the exterior angle is greater than the interior and opposite angle, [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)] therefore, in the triangle CDE, the exterior angle BDC is greater than the angle CED."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为任意三角形的外角大于与它不相邻的内角 [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]，所以在三角形 CDE 中，外角 BDC 大于角 CED。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d30c8587df041fc9f515a74d05a055fbcb402fb9b467d0353a29afeca0ce72af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, moreover, in the triangle ABE also, the exterior angle CEB is greater than the angle BAC. But the angle BDC was proved greater than the angle CEB; therefore the angle BDC is much greater than the angle BAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理，在三角形 ABE 中，外角 CEB 大于角 BAC。又已证明角 BDC 大于角 CEB，因此角 BDC 也大于角 BAC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4456874ef6cd025dbdcb85fa328df7924dc9ba24c7f1ad1f8eb2661ba4a713a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形于一边之两界出两线复作一三角形在其内则内形两腰并之必小于相对两腰而后两线所作角必大于相对角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从三角形一边的两个端点引出两条线，在其内部构成另一个三角形，那么内三角形两腰的长度之和一定小于外三角形对应两边的长度之和；这两条内侧线段所夹的角大于外三角形对应的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5afbbf577d430e256c2d98055ef3b1c2b9be3f5313ee752e5d2192c1a3bafa3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形于乙丙边之两界各出一线遇于丁题言丁丙丁乙两线并必小于甲乙甲丙并而乙丁丙角必大于乙甲丙角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设三角形甲乙丙。从边乙丙的两个端点分别引出线段，使它们相交于点丁。命题要证明：丁丙与丁乙的长度之和小于甲乙与甲丙的长度之和，并且角乙丁丙大于角乙甲丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"650a2ba5e48f776b5eea9eb2974ac97c0f0b2db3908d67669228e545f243f536","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试用内一线引长之如乙丁引之至戊即乙甲戊角形之乙甲甲戊两线并必大于乙戊线也〈本篇二十〉此二率者每加一戊丙线则乙甲甲戊戊丙并必大于乙戊戊丙并矣〈公论四〉又戊丁丙角形之戊丁戊丙线并必大于丁丙线也此二率者每加一丁乙线则戊丁戊丙丁乙并必大于丁丙丁乙并矣〈公论四〉夫乙甲甲戊戊丙既大于乙戊戊丙岂不更大于丁丙丁乙乎〈本篇二十〉又乙甲戊角形之丙戊丁外角大于相对之乙甲戊内角〈本篇十六〉即丁戊丙角形之乙丁丙外角更大于相对之丁戊丙内角矣而乙丁丙角岂不更大于乙甲丙角乎"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：将内部线段乙丁延长到戊。在三角形乙甲戊中，乙甲与甲戊的长度之和大于乙戊〈本篇二十〉。两边同时加上戊丙，得到乙甲、甲戊、戊丙的长度之和大于乙戊与戊丙的长度之和〈公论四〉。又在三角形戊丁丙中，戊丁与戊丙的长度之和大于丁丙；两边同时加上丁乙，得到戊丁、戊丙、丁乙的长度之和大于丁丙与丁乙的长度之和〈公论四〉。因此，外三角形两边乙甲、甲丙的长度之和大于内三角形两边丁丙、丁乙的长度之和〈本篇二十〉。再由三角形外角大于与它不相邻的内角〈本篇十六〉，可知角乙丁丙大于角乙甲丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-21.source","contentId":"euclid-1-21","revisionId":"euclid-1-21@raw-db968d6fd5ac16b0","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4633b9a9226a9c1a1b6b3b58c2757e7abd4c4bdda695f1ce195c5e3af3de388a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-21:euclid-1-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-21.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21/","sourceLabel":"I. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-21:euclid-1-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-21.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.21/","sourceLabel":"I. 16"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-8:euclid-1-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-8.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"I. 21"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-21:euclid-1-20:explicit","id":"euclid-1-20","book":1,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角不等式：两边之和大于第三边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-21:euclid-1-16:explicit","id":"euclid-1-16","book":1,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形外角大于任一不相邻内角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-8:euclid-1-21:explicit","id":"euclid-3-8","book":3,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆外任取一点从点任出几线其至规内则过圆心线最大馀线愈离心愈小其至规外则过圆…","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-triangle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
